    "System.Description": "<p>Development work for User Story <a href=\"https://quorumsoftware.visualstudio.com/Quorum/_workitems/edit/1880262\">1880262</a>. </p>\n<h3>Development scope </h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Implement the Planning Space Web route and Report Designer host. </li>\n<li>Implement authenticated template loading and isolated editor sessions. </li>\n<li>Implement the validated host communication contract, lifecycle events, dirty state, loading states, and error handling. </li>\n<li>Release client and server resources when the editor closes, expires, or fails. </li>\n<li>Add developer-owned automated tests and complete browser smoke verification with a representative existing template. </li>\n<li>Address code-review findings and prepare the build and fixtures for the separate testing Task. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>Testing execution and acceptance testing are tracked in a separate child Task. </p>",
